WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:03.102
1 · Add ElevatedButton: Flutter’s filled button. Design mode selects it for editing.

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:07.739
2 · Open Actions. Choose Increment a counter. This is what happens when pressed.

00:00:07.739 --> 00:00:15.315
3 · Switch to Interact. Now the button runs its action instead of being selected.

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:18.619
The count is 2. onPressed is the callback: the function Flutter runs when you press.

00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:24.080
The numbered list finds controls. Reset values returns the count to zero.
